        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih rynghmei duiriang hei lui tat lana,",
            "Huthang namdaih gaimei Kanaan ram tei;",
            "Akhang neihla mei pirun tei naguang the,",
            "Kapma kandi ram khou hei bamsaeng lak khe.",
            "",
            "Tingsaeng lak khe kandi rianra mei guai,",
            "Kau bampui khuan tei ai chulouna,",
            "Guangh bampaeng khou nkhuan ngam makpui khuan rui,",
            "Zianmei nun kaapmei tingsaeng lak khe tu e.",
            "",
            "2. Ai bampui ram duiriang hei saeng khuansini,",
            "Zailoumei Pu gaanphiu ta zau lana;",
            "Tingkao nthanpui ram tanglou puni the,",
            "Khou tei nzianmei nun ntam dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "3. Nzuanni the ai tingsaeng gaipui ram tei,",
            "Munpuang gaimei guai tei puangtuai makge;",
            "Lauziu Na le tingkao munpuang ram tei,",
            "He! Nangzei pan khou ruina ai guang tangni.",
            "",
            "4. Sa bammei ram gaimei khou guang tang pukhou,",
            "Theithu maam kan nimei ta ning lak khe",
            "Poubaomei ram tigaan loumei guai tei ni,",
            "Tak makna tingsaeng zaeng gaanbam puni the."
          ]
        }
      }
